document don't create.

00:00:17.918 --> 00:00:19.386
Don't over think it.

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:21.755
You can produce 
unlimited content every day,

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.056
every day, every day.

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:24.558
