00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.462
Don't be romantic 
just do, do, do,

00:00:28.462 --> 00:00:30.597
do, do, don't listen, 
do, do, do,

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:32.312
do, do, don't listen.

